{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Saloon Simulator</strong> invites you to become the boss of your own entertainment hall!<br>Are you ready to turn a small bar into a giant gaming complex?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll serve customer orders and manage various entertainment items like pool tables, dart boards, karaoke stages, foosball, and table tennis. Buy classic arcade machines and place them strategically to boost your saloon\u2019s appeal, and expand your venue by unlocking new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not all \u2014 just like your customers, you can also enjoy the games! Grow your business while having fun in your own game saloon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expandable saloon system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive entertainment equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Service mechanics that increase customer satisfaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom to design your own play area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, humorous, and enjoyable simulation experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the &quot;Game Saloon&quot; you\u2019ve always dreamed of \u2014 manage it and have fun!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753880?t=1761642778","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753880?t=1761642778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/c73e3b25bf21974ff45ad40b9bc7ea65d337ad25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761642778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/c73e3b25bf21974ff45ad40b9bc7ea65d337ad25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761642778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descript